us segment"],[757,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[865,"**Arrow Up** / **Arrow Down** (or **Up** / **Down**): increase or decrease by `step`"],[756,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[966,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1596,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[562,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[617,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1592,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1591,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[567,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1594,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1539,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1748,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[641,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1630,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1625,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1627,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1626,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[639,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1629,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[229,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[228,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[625,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The spri