**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[1420,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[709,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1538,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1633,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[629,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1595,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[646,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1599,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1423,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[640,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1030,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[561,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[866,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[627,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[644,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[637,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[962,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[961,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[711,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1195,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[1425,"**React Aria integration**: